data: {"id": "cb57055f69f84215-final", "run_id": "cb57055f69f84215", "seq": 2306, "ts_ms": 1789140107207, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v10/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | CrashLoopBackOff |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Warning BackOff ... Back-off restarting failed container app ... (x7 over 84s)` | 确认容器 `app` 因反复退出触发 Kubernetes 的重启退避机制 |\n| 2 | K8s State | container | `last_terminated_reason: Error`, `last_exit_code: 78` | 提供直接的应用程序退出原因与退出码 |\n| 3 | Logging | elasticsearch | `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing` | 明确指出导致应用启动失败的具体缺失配置 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Reason: CrashLoopBackOff` | 将上述事件归类为标准的重启故障 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason(app, Error): 1` | 独立印证容器最后一次终止状态为 Error |\n| 6 | K8s State | pod | `restart_count: 3` (aggregation, record_count: 2) | 证实故障已持续存在并经历了多次重启周期 |\n\n上述 K8s 状态与日志提供了互相印证的因果证据：应用因缺失环境变量（日志）而主动退出（Code 78），进而触发集群的 Back-off 重启事件（K8s Event），最终导致 Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺少环境变量 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG` → 应用启动读取失败 → 主动执行 sys.exit(78) → 触发 Backoff 重启\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 Pod 容器 `app` 的启动配置中遗漏了必需的环境变量 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG`。\n\n应用启动时因该变量缺失而执行 `sys.exit(78)`（见 Logging fact #3），导致进程以异常退出码 78 终止（见 K8s State fact #2）。Kubernetes 监控系统捕获到该终止状态（Metric fact #5），并启动了指数退避的重启策略，导致集群观察到 `CrashLoopBackOff` 症状（见 K8s Event fact #1, #4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.9m\n├─ 问题定位: 27.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 80.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v10/workload: 80.2s (Evidence 72.2s, RCA 7.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v10/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 115.147, "metrics": {"run_id": "cb57055f69f84215", "mttr": {"value": "1.9m", "seconds": 115.15418076515198, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-config-error, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 115154.18076515198, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 95105.21411895752, "tool_calls": 30, "executed_tool_calls": 19, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 11, "successful_tool_calls": 30, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 43511.27791404724, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 19624.826192855835}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 27431.46061897278, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 80193.60828399658, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "d